This project includes material derived from harness-engine
(https://github.com/SimSimEEE/harness-engine), licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:

  - scripts/secret-scan.mjs: the secret pattern table and the sensitive-path list are ported from
    skills/preflight/secret-patterns.json (version 4). Changes: Python inline flags rewritten as
    JavaScript regex flags; an email-address warning and deny-term checks were added.
  - .claude/harness/agents/test-runner.md: a modified copy of agents/test-runner.md
    (jest steps replaced with vitest; provenance comment added).

harness-engine itself is not vendored. .claude/harness/setup.sh fetches it at the commit pinned in
.claude/harness/ENGINE_PIN into git-ignored directories.
